# KLAIM 2025 revision 2 -- 2D case list (one job per line). Lines starting with # are ignored.
# columns: name  wsteg  material  gc  sig_y  hard  embedding  nrows  crack_factor  geometry
#   name         : unique job/folder name (letters, digits, _ . -)
#   wsteg        : wall width w_s / L
#   material     : vonmises | elastic
#   gc           : J_c / J_c^0 (1.0 for [vM] and [Eq Jc]; [Eq sigma*]: 0.5523 = (sig*_vM/sig*_EqJc)^2 of the 1D bar with beta = 0.2
#                  (bar1d_homogeneous_check.py, FE 050: 1.2803/1.7237; the v2.0 value 0.5679 belongs to sig* = 1.30, i.e. beta = 0.1 / Ramberg-Osgood)
#   sig_y, hard  : yield stress / hardening modulus of the porous region (ignored for elastic)
#   embedding    : isotropic | cubic   (constitutive law of the homogeneous embedding)
#   nrows        : number of rows of unit cells (3 = paper)
#   crack_factor : initial crack length = crack_factor * w_c   (1.0 = paper: tip at the left edge of the porous block)
#   geometry     : porous | strip  (strip = no pores, homogeneous calibration of J_c^num, Fig. 3)
#
